(4482256, 646447, 30712, '<td valign="top">This was a difficult subject and there were few inspirational photos but this was one of them.  I can feel the dough and the flour.  The contrast and gloom in the background give this image a moody, sensual ambience.  I just love it.</td>', 'This was a difficult subject and there were few inspirational photos but this was one of them.  I can feel the dough and the flour.  The contrast and gloom in the background give this image a moody, sensual ambience.  I just love it.', '2008-02-13 01:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
