(4483348, 646430, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great job handling the lighting and tough reflections. The toast is a little "well done" IMO, and it would''ve been nice to get a red glow inside the toaster.</td>', 'Great job handling the lighting and tough reflections. The toast is a little "well done" IMO, and it would''ve been nice to get a red glow inside the toaster.', '2008-02-13 12:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483355, 646440, 57229, '<td valign="top">Damned hard stuff to photograph. This is good, but it doesn''t look either real or appetising. I''m blaming the lighting for that.</td>', 'Damned hard stuff to photograph. This is good, but it doesn''t look either real or appetising. I''m blaming the lighting for that.', '2008-02-13 12:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483357, 646176, 57229, '<td valign="top">Vegans see the world through magenta coloured glasses.</td>', 'Vegans see the world through magenta coloured glasses.', '2008-02-13 12:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483360, 646006, 57229, '<td valign="top">I wonder why it looks like toast.</td>', 'I wonder why it looks like toast.', '2008-02-13 12:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483372, 643437, 57229, '<td valign="top">Might have benefited from the light being less directional and more diffuse. I think also the colour might be better jacked down instead of up, but it''s a noble effort at capturing the essence of the challenge.</td>', 'Might have benefited from the light being less directional and more diffuse. I think also the colour might be better jacked down instead of up, but it''s a noble effort at capturing the essence of the challenge.', '2008-02-13 12:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483374, 646301, 57229, '<td valign="top">You got the subject right. Too shiny. I''m guessing the store chose the lighting?</td>', 'You got the subject right. Too shiny. I''m guessing the store chose the lighting?', '2008-02-13 12:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483379, 646054, 68586, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot and good work. <br/> <br/>The Hamster is obviously a lot further away than he first looks, because the bite out of the bagel is HUGE !!  :  )<br/> <br/>Perfect framing in the doorway though.</td>', 'Sweet shot and good work.  The Hamster is obviously a lot further away than he first looks, because the bite out of the bagel is HUGE !!  :  ) Perfect framing in the doorway though.', '2008-02-13 12:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483382, 645826, 57229, '<td valign="top">Very simple. Very bread. Loadsa points. (Good light, good colour). Damn, I''m impressed.</td>', 'Very simple. Very bread. Loadsa points. (Good light, good colour). Damn, I''m impressed.', '2008-02-13 12:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483384, 646044, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lol - looks like a scene from ''invasion of the bodysnatchers'' they all grew in pods.<br/> <br/>A good idea, but perhaps a little lost with the various lines and light and dark areas.</td>', 'Lol - looks like a scene from ''invasion of the bodysnatchers'' they all grew in pods. A good idea, but perhaps a little lost with the various lines and light and dark areas.', '2008-02-13 12:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483392, 646005, 68586, '<td valign="top">great timing !<br/> <br/>Sadly it gets a little lost in the overall picture. You have lots of horizontal and vertical lines leading the eye all over the place, instead of drawing it in to the thing you want the viewer to focus on.</td>', 'great timing ! Sadly it gets a little lost in the overall picture. You have lots of horizontal and vertical lines leading the eye all over the place, instead of drawing it in to the thing you want the viewer to focus on.', '2008-02-13 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
