(4483441, 644654, 68586, '<td valign="top">I saw the sequel ''Death Bread II'' nowhere near as good in my opinion, same old story line, car chases etc etc . . . went straight to Video.<br/> <br/>To be honest I''m not sure where you are going with this. I can see that you have a nice (and expensive) taste in kitchen knives, and a big pile of yucky looking bread . . I get a bit lost after that. Is it a word play ? or am I just being dense ?  I might come back later and look again, see if it is clearer then.</td>', 'I saw the sequel ''Death Bread II'' nowhere near as good in my opinion, same old story line, car chases etc etc . . . went straight to Video. To be honest I''m not sure where you are going with this. I can see that you have a nice (and expensive) taste in kitchen knives, and a big pile of yucky looking bread . . I get a bit lost after that. Is it a word play ? or am I just being dense ?  I might come back later and look again, see if it is clearer then.', '2008-02-13 13:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
