(4483764, 644621, 70689, '<td valign="top">hmmmm, not sure whether I don''t get it or don''t like it. I think this picture contains many elements that distract from what I think is the subject of your picture. To start with the subject, it is a bread with some sauce or creamcheese on the outside. I don''t understand why you framed it that way, but I do not think it is a pretty sight. The lighting is very harsh, probably a direct flash. Direct flashes produce reflections, blown highlights and sharp shadows. Next time, try to soften the light, either by bouncing it off a ceiling or by putting some kind of diffusing material (e.g. a tissue) in front of it. <br/> <br/>The picture also suffers from many distracting elements, both in the back and to the left, as well as the left bottom corner. You can easily prevent this by emptying the table before you take the picture.</td>', 'hmmmm, not sure whether I don''t get it or don''t like it. I think this picture contains many elements that distract from what I think is the subject of your picture. To start with the subject, it is a bread with some sauce or creamcheese on the outside. I don''t understand why you framed it that way, but I do not think it is a pretty sight. The lighting is very harsh, probably a direct flash. Direct flashes produce reflections, blown highlights and sharp shadows. Next time, try to soften the light, either by bouncing it off a ceiling or by putting some kind of diffusing material (e.g. a tissue) in front of it.  The picture also suffers from many distracting elements, both in the back and to the left, as well as the left bottom corner. You can easily prevent this by emptying the table before you take the picture.', '2008-02-13 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483765, 646243, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice pic. Love the sharpness and the texture. Reflection fits in nicely as well. 8</td>', 'Nice pic. Love the sharpness and the texture. Reflection fits in nicely as well. 8', '2008-02-13 15:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483767, 646286, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very nice.<br/> <br/>Nice continuity here between the title, the butter heart, the colours on the table cloth.<br/> <br/>Nice clean uncluttered shot.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Very nice. Nice continuity here between the title, the butter heart, the colours on the table cloth. Nice clean uncluttered shot. Well done.', '2008-02-13 15:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483769, 646313, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for minimalism and just love empty space. But this one does not work for me, because your subject is too far to the edges of the pic. This would have worked so much better if you left some room <i>around</i> the subject instead of just to the right of it. Execution is fine though.</td>', 'I am a sucker for minimalism and just love empty space. But this one does not work for me, because your subject is too far to the edges of the pic. This would have worked so much better if you left some room around the subject instead of just to the right of it. Execution is fine though.', '2008-02-13 15:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483776, 643860, 70689, '<td valign="top">Good thinking, bw works well here. I would have liked it even better if the upper crust of the bread would have a slight ''hairight'' to make it come loose from the background.</td>', 'Good thinking, bw works well here. I would have liked it even better if the upper crust of the bread would have a slight ''hairight'' to make it come loose from the background.', '2008-02-13 15:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
