(4483793, 645770, 57886, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture - the light here is great, 8 from me!!! Why not a 9 or a 10 - well, I don´t really like the crop that much, one arm a little out of the picture and you can see a part of the feet without seeing all of them... and the empty space above is IMHO a little to much BUT this one is probably going to be in the top 3 seats because it is one of the best in this challenge... good luck and well done :o)</td>', 'I really like this picture - the light here is great, 8 from me!!! Why not a 9 or a 10 - well, I don´t really like the crop that much, one arm a little out of the picture and you can see a part of the feet without seeing all of them... and the empty space above is IMHO a little to much BUT this one is probably going to be in the top 3 seats because it is one of the best in this challenge... good luck and well done :o)', '2008-02-13 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
