(4483866, 645973, 70689, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed still life of bread and the texture of the bread stands out well. It has however some problems. First of all, your white balance is off, the light is too warm. You can and should correct for this, either in-camera or in PP. Second, there are several distracting elements in the background. With a still life, try to keep your background as neutral as possible. Third, I would have liked a slightly lower POV on this one, to give it a more classic still life look.</td>', 'This is a nicely composed still life of bread and the texture of the bread stands out well. It has however some problems. First of all, your white balance is off, the light is too warm. You can and should correct for this, either in-camera or in PP. Second, there are several distracting elements in the background. With a still life, try to keep your background as neutral as possible. Third, I would have liked a slightly lower POV on this one, to give it a more classic still life look.', '2008-02-13 15:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4483868, 646139, 85102, '<td valign="top">slightly over saturated or something. It looks a little noisy too! but great shot... she''s a cutie!</td>', 'slightly over saturated or something. It looks a little noisy too! but great shot... she''s a cutie!', '2008-02-13 15:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
