(4484008, 645542, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, I like the black background but would have been tempted to clean up some of the crumbs.</td>', 'Nice setup, I like the black background but would have been tempted to clean up some of the crumbs.', '2008-02-13 16:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4484009, 644076, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like it. The lighting and minimalist approach work well for me. I also appreciate the near abstract nature of the pic. I just wonder about the crop. You have now cropped this pic to an image with very non-photographic dimensions (which suggests you haven''t thought enough about composition before shooting). I would have liked it even better if you just had a standard 3:2 portrait, with a lot of empty space on the left hand side. 7</td>', 'Nice, I like it. The lighting and minimalist approach work well for me. I also appreciate the near abstract nature of the pic. I just wonder about the crop. You have now cropped this pic to an image with very non-photographic dimensions (which suggests you haven''t thought enough about composition before shooting). I would have liked it even better if you just had a standard 3:2 portrait, with a lot of empty space on the left hand side. 7', '2008-02-13 16:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4484011, 645698, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, good detail but that busy background is not doing anything for me.</td>', 'Nice setup, good detail but that busy background is not doing anything for me.', '2008-02-13 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
