(4484018, 644152, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lol - I think for a bikini I would have bought a nice big round loaf, cut it in two and hollowed it out to form natural cups . . but enough bread talk - as for the picture, the ideas fun, the background is a little distracting for me and I would like to have seen a bit of eye contact from the model. She actually looks like she''s worried the whole outfit is going to fall to bits .  : )<br/> <br/>Still fun though</td>', 'Lol - I think for a bikini I would have bought a nice big round loaf, cut it in two and hollowed it out to form natural cups . . but enough bread talk - as for the picture, the ideas fun, the background is a little distracting for me and I would like to have seen a bit of eye contact from the model. She actually looks like she''s worried the whole outfit is going to fall to bits .  : ) Still fun though', '2008-02-13 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
