(4484088, 646415, 71526, '<td valign="top">most of the image is out of focus... you probably choosed that F/1.8 but it seems to extreme for me here. The idea with this bread is great, so 6.</td>', 'most of the image is out of focus... you probably choosed that F/1.8 but it seems to extreme for me here. The idea with this bread is great, so 6.', '2008-02-13 16:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
