(4484201, 646054, 89333, '<td valign="top">Great image and idea! I find that the twigs on the left lead my eye out of the image to a degree. Maybe you could have trimmed or otherwise maneuvered them to remain in the frame.</td>', 'Great image and idea! I find that the twigs on the left lead my eye out of the image to a degree. Maybe you could have trimmed or otherwise maneuvered them to remain in the frame.', '2008-02-13 17:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
