(4486615, 646365, 68586, '<td valign="top">Well it''s certainly bread : )<br/> <br/>The question is does the picture really sell the title ''Natures Own'' ? Unfortunately the distinctive visual feature is the glare of the plastic bags which is certainly not natural. Perhaps if we could have seen at least one loaf unwrapped so that we could have seen the colour and texture of the bread ? <br/> <br/>Also it would be worth buying even some cheap black card so that you can have a nice uniform background - you''ve done pretty well here, but there are some tiles creeping in above the loaf on the left.</td>', 'Well it''s certainly bread : ) The question is does the picture really sell the title ''Natures Own'' ? Unfortunately the distinctive visual feature is the glare of the plastic bags which is certainly not natural. Perhaps if we could have seen at least one loaf unwrapped so that we could have seen the colour and texture of the bread ?  Also it would be worth buying even some cheap black card so that you can have a nice uniform background - you''ve done pretty well here, but there are some tiles creeping in above the loaf on the left.', '2008-02-14 13:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486634, 646417, 84438, '<td valign="top">Just excellent.  One of my favs of the challenge.  Nicely done.<br/>8</td>', 'Just excellent.  One of my favs of the challenge.  Nicely done.8', '2008-02-14 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486635, 646428, 84438, '<td valign="top">VERY VERY creative!  Excellent work on this one.<br/>8.</td>', 'VERY VERY creative!  Excellent work on this one.8.', '2008-02-14 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486637, 645362, 84438, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job.  This really looks like a landscape scene.  Way to take an ordinary subject and come up with an extremely creative photograph.</td>', 'Fantastic job.  This really looks like a landscape scene.  Way to take an ordinary subject and come up with an extremely creative photograph.', '2008-02-14 13:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486638, 646431, 84438, '<td valign="top">Love it.  One of my favs of the challenge.  Composition is excellent, as is the B&amp;W conversion.<br/>8.</td>', 'Love it.  One of my favs of the challenge.  Composition is excellent, as is the B&W conversion.8.', '2008-02-14 13:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486640, 646138, 84438, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this.  It''s a bit dark, but it is a very unique photo.  I think it''s great.<br/>7.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this.  It''s a bit dark, but it is a very unique photo.  I think it''s great.7.', '2008-02-14 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486641, 646467, 84438, '<td valign="top">An excellent implementation of a cliched idea.  Even though it has been done to death, this looks technically perfect.<br/>7.</td>', 'An excellent implementation of a cliched idea.  Even though it has been done to death, this looks technically perfect.7.', '2008-02-14 13:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486642, 646197, 84438, '<td valign="top">Excellent creativity and the composition and colours make this a very pleasing photograph.  Nice work!</td>', 'Excellent creativity and the composition and colours make this a very pleasing photograph.  Nice work!', '2008-02-14 13:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486643, 645515, 84438, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  The outdoor picnic scene add originality.  The subjects in your background look a bit artifacty (The ''glow'' around the people), but it''s still excellent.<br/>7.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  The outdoor picnic scene add originality.  The subjects in your background look a bit artifacty (The ''glow'' around the people), but it''s still excellent.7.', '2008-02-14 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486644, 645421, 84438, '<td valign="top">What a cool looking photo.  The spotted fabric, the plug and the reflection, the brick wall.  Everything works together beautifully.<br/>7.</td>', 'What a cool looking photo.  The spotted fabric, the plug and the reflection, the brick wall.  Everything works together beautifully.7.', '2008-02-14 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486645, 643437, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautful lighting, and excellent composition.  Nice work to get this look in basic editting..  An excellent control of light.<br/>7.</td>', 'Beautful lighting, and excellent composition.  Nice work to get this look in basic editting..  An excellent control of light.7.', '2008-02-14 13:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486646, 645411, 84438, '<td valign="top">Hehe.  What an original photo.  This is great.  <br/>7.</td>', 'Hehe.  What an original photo.  This is great.  7.', '2008-02-14 13:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4486647, 644329, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting this capture!  Beautiful and fits the challenge to a ''T''!<br/>7.</td>', 'Nice job getting this capture!  Beautiful and fits the challenge to a ''T''!7.', '2008-02-14 13:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
