(4489002, 645698, 58691, '<td valign="top">The foreground is excellent in composition, exposure and clarity, but the background is a bit overbearing and doesn''t compliment the shot. <br/> <br/>oh, and clean your fingernails. :)</td>', 'The foreground is excellent in composition, exposure and clarity, but the background is a bit overbearing and doesn''t compliment the shot.  oh, and clean your fingernails. :)', '2008-02-15 14:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
