(4489028, 645973, 58691, '<td valign="top">The white balance seems to be way off in this shot and it is a bit too cluttered. I studied it trying to see if you were attempting to tell a story with this setup - different breads/empty sugar free jars/caps on - caps off, etc. But wasn''t able to make out anything. <br/> <br/>Mmmm, I do love black raspberry jam though.</td>', 'The white balance seems to be way off in this shot and it is a bit too cluttered. I studied it trying to see if you were attempting to tell a story with this setup - different breads/empty sugar free jars/caps on - caps off, etc. But wasn''t able to make out anything.  Mmmm, I do love black raspberry jam though.', '2008-02-15 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489036, 644330, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is really an amazing shot - maybe a bit too strong on the noise reduction, but that may be the look you were going for. This is my highest rated image in the challenge so far. Well done.</td>', 'This is really an amazing shot - maybe a bit too strong on the noise reduction, but that may be the look you were going for. This is my highest rated image in the challenge so far. Well done.', '2008-02-15 14:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489037, 645721, 55892, '<td valign="top">that''s what happens when you leave the kids alone with the bread out! I like the contrasting textures of the wood &amp; bread, and the crumbs are good. I think you should have cropped out that upper rt. corner or tried one more shot.</td>', 'that''s what happens when you leave the kids alone with the bread out! I like the contrasting textures of the wood & bread, and the crumbs are good. I think you should have cropped out that upper rt. corner or tried one more shot.', '2008-02-15 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489040, 644011, 58691, '<td valign="top">White balance is off, noise is extremely high, and the image is blurry. This probably would''ve come out much better in macro mode</td>', 'White balance is off, noise is extremely high, and the image is blurry. This probably would''ve come out much better in macro mode', '2008-02-15 15:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489045, 646118, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, not cluttered or complicated. Could perhaps do with a little more ''Wow'' factor, but very pleasant.</td>', 'Nice shot, not cluttered or complicated. Could perhaps do with a little more ''Wow'' factor, but very pleasant.', '2008-02-15 15:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489049, 646138, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice detail and textures. Good DoF</td>', 'nice detail and textures. Good DoF', '2008-02-15 15:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489052, 646467, 68586, '<td valign="top">A nice range of shapes and colours, a pity the wine wasn''t a little brighter to act as a balance to the rose.<br/> <br/>A nice evenings eating after the shoot though  : )</td>', 'A nice range of shapes and colours, a pity the wine wasn''t a little brighter to act as a balance to the rose. A nice evenings eating after the shoot though  : )', '2008-02-15 15:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489053, 646289, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great shot - really like it</td>', 'Great shot - really like it', '2008-02-15 15:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489055, 644330, 55892, '<td valign="top">Stunning! I''m trying to decide if the bread itself is too close in color to the background, but, then, the texture &amp; the reflection  draws my eyes to it.  Great job.</td>', 'Stunning! I''m trying to decide if the bread itself is too close in color to the background, but, then, the texture & the reflection  draws my eyes to it.  Great job.', '2008-02-15 15:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489057, 644184, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot. Does the bread under his pillow know that he''s cheating on it with another loaf ?</td>', 'Nice clear shot. Does the bread under his pillow know that he''s cheating on it with another loaf ?', '2008-02-15 15:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489065, 646431, 55892, '<td valign="top">Love those eyes! I think the man''s hands should be dirty &amp; fingernails not so well groomed. (Icould be wrong)</td>', 'Love those eyes! I think the man''s hands should be dirty & fingernails not so well groomed. (Icould be wrong)', '2008-02-15 15:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489075, 646265, 55892, '<td valign="top">Good color contrast on the crust. You''re making me hungry! This is how they torture you in restraunts while you wait for your entree.</td>', 'Good color contrast on the crust. You''re making me hungry! This is how they torture you in restraunts while you wait for your entree.', '2008-02-15 15:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489081, 644735, 55892, '<td valign="top">Good approach.  I think the jelly could be a stronger color, &amp; the PB itself does not stand out against the color of the bread.</td>', 'Good approach.  I think the jelly could be a stronger color, & the PB itself does not stand out against the color of the bread.', '2008-02-15 15:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489090, 646474, 55892, '<td valign="top">I like it!  excellent color contrast, beautiful pine needles.  The clip used to hang the bread reminds me of a Christmas tree.  The foreground should be less diffused.</td>', 'I like it!  excellent color contrast, beautiful pine needles.  The clip used to hang the bread reminds me of a Christmas tree.  The foreground should be less diffused.', '2008-02-15 15:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489093, 646143, 55892, '<td valign="top">Just begging to be torn open.  Great textures.</td>', 'Just begging to be torn open.  Great textures.', '2008-02-15 15:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489114, 645362, 55892, '<td valign="top">You are just too clever!  You used the rosemary so artistically by giving it 2 interpretations:  the added focus on the flavor, &amp; the visual suggestion of pine trees.  And then, there''s that reflection!  Now that I''ve looked at it some more I get an idea of an iceberg.  I love anything with rosemary in it!</td>', 'You are just too clever!  You used the rosemary so artistically by giving it 2 interpretations:  the added focus on the flavor, & the visual suggestion of pine trees.  And then, there''s that reflection!  Now that I''ve looked at it some more I get an idea of an iceberg.  I love anything with rosemary in it!', '2008-02-15 15:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489120, 645424, 55892, '<td valign="top">creative.  The image could be sharper, &amp; the background could show more contrast.  Also, the shadow detracts from the whole.  Good composition.</td>', 'creative.  The image could be sharper, & the background could show more contrast.  Also, the shadow detracts from the whole.  Good composition.', '2008-02-15 15:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489124, 643708, 55892, '<td valign="top">Awww, you made this for Valentine''s Day, didn''t you!  This has great contrasting colors;  blue &amp; orange.  The orange flowers in the tablecloth complement the color of the PB.   The PB itself showed those darn reflections.</td>', 'Awww, you made this for Valentine''s Day, didn''t you!  This has great contrasting colors;  blue & orange.  The orange flowers in the tablecloth complement the color of the PB.   The PB itself showed those darn reflections.', '2008-02-15 15:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489127, 645890, 55892, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  Focus could be tweaked some.</td>', 'Good composition.  Focus could be tweaked some.', '2008-02-15 15:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489128, 646254, 55892, '<td valign="top">What a mess!</td>', 'What a mess!', '2008-02-15 15:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489173, 646447, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone, texture, and lighting in this.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I really like the tone, texture, and lighting in this.  Nicely done!', '2008-02-15 15:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489177, 646420, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement, and good use of natural window light overall.</td>', 'Very nice arrangement, and good use of natural window light overall.', '2008-02-15 15:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4489180, 645944, 30049, '<td valign="top">Certainly good for a laugh in the DPC community.  :-D  The color choices work very well here.  Good luck!</td>', 'Certainly good for a laugh in the DPC community.  :-D  The color choices work very well here.  Good luck!', '2008-02-15 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
