(4490111, 646426, 70689, '<td valign="top">That''s a funny gadget for sure. But is it also a good picture? I am sorry to say I think it is not. In my opinion it has several problems. First of all, the use of your onboard flash causes harsh light and hard shadows. Next time, try diffusing or bouncing the light of your flash with simple means like paper tissues. I also think the crop is too narrow on the bottom of your picture, causing the cup to be cut off. As a minor point, I would like to advise you to clean your workspace before taking a picture.</td>', 'That''s a funny gadget for sure. But is it also a good picture? I am sorry to say I think it is not. In my opinion it has several problems. First of all, the use of your onboard flash causes harsh light and hard shadows. Next time, try diffusing or bouncing the light of your flash with simple means like paper tissues. I also think the crop is too narrow on the bottom of your picture, causing the cup to be cut off. As a minor point, I would like to advise you to clean your workspace before taking a picture.', '2008-02-16 03:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
