(4493496, 643984, 89452, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts.</td>', 'I like the contrasts.', '2008-02-18 00:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493497, 645991, 89452, '<td valign="top">Nice spacing.</td>', 'Nice spacing.', '2008-02-18 00:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493498, 646042, 89452, '<td valign="top">Good setup. May have sold better in black and white.</td>', 'Good setup. May have sold better in black and white.', '2008-02-18 00:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493500, 645362, 89452, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that this was an alligator laying in wait. Nice reflection.</td>', 'My first impression was that this was an alligator laying in wait. Nice reflection.', '2008-02-18 00:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493502, 646197, 89452, '<td valign="top">balanced bread</td>', 'balanced bread', '2008-02-18 00:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493613, 643839, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, sharpness and texture, AND it is appetizing, but it is a little dark IMO. I give it a strong 7.</td>', 'Nice DOF, sharpness and texture, AND it is appetizing, but it is a little dark IMO. I give it a strong 7.', '2008-02-18 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493617, 644317, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and texture, but I find the highlights a little distracting. 7.</td>', 'Nice DOF and texture, but I find the highlights a little distracting. 7.', '2008-02-18 00:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493621, 644775, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very eye-catching! Nice framing effect.  I would like to see the whole loaf in focus though. 8.</td>', 'Very eye-catching! Nice framing effect.  I would like to see the whole loaf in focus though. 8.', '2008-02-18 01:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493624, 646431, 90380, '<td valign="top">Love it. Almost a solid 10.</td>', 'Love it. Almost a solid 10.', '2008-02-18 01:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493629, 644330, 90380, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures and lighting! First 10 for me so far.</td>', 'Beautiful textures and lighting! First 10 for me so far.', '2008-02-18 01:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493634, 645485, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot. I would have liked to see the colour in the bread warmed up and enriched a bit to make it look more appetizing, but it is good nonetheless.</td>', 'Nicely shot. I would have liked to see the colour in the bread warmed up and enriched a bit to make it look more appetizing, but it is good nonetheless.', '2008-02-18 01:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493635, 646176, 90380, '<td valign="top">I like the humour in the title. The shot needs some more light though, but the arrangement on the plate is nice.</td>', 'I like the humour in the title. The shot needs some more light though, but the arrangement on the plate is nice.', '2008-02-18 01:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493642, 645468, 90380, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but it looks like the subject is a bit out of focus. The focus looks like it is on the front of the cutting board rather than the food. I give a 7.</td>', 'Nice composition, but it looks like the subject is a bit out of focus. The focus looks like it is on the front of the cutting board rather than the food. I give a 7.', '2008-02-18 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493644, 645699, 90380, '<td valign="top">So cute and well done!! It''s a 10 for me.</td>', 'So cute and well done!! It''s a 10 for me.', '2008-02-18 01:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493646, 645376, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very striking. I like it.</td>', 'Very striking. I like it.', '2008-02-18 01:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493662, 646282, 90380, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I would score it higher if it was a little more appetizing looking. Perhaps your intention was to make it strikingly.. icky (sorry) but it just doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I would score it higher if it was a little more appetizing looking. Perhaps your intention was to make it strikingly.. icky (sorry) but it just doesn''t do it for me.', '2008-02-18 01:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493664, 646428, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea!</td>', 'Very cool idea!', '2008-02-18 01:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493666, 645515, 90380, '<td valign="top">What I like about this one is that the arrangment of the items is very professional looking.  The out-of-focus people in the background make the image look almost like an ad (which is a good thing IMO) but I think it would be more balanced if either the people or the wine bottle was moved to the other side.  The flash of white in the b/g is distracting as well. Definitely has potential though! Strong 7 from me.</td>', 'What I like about this one is that the arrangment of the items is very professional looking.  The out-of-focus people in the background make the image look almost like an ad (which is a good thing IMO) but I think it would be more balanced if either the people or the wine bottle was moved to the other side.  The flash of white in the b/g is distracting as well. Definitely has potential though! Strong 7 from me.', '2008-02-18 01:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493667, 644735, 90380, '<td valign="top">This one could use some levels and curved IMO, but other than that, it looks yummy! :-) 7.</td>', 'This one could use some levels and curved IMO, but other than that, it looks yummy! :-) 7.', '2008-02-18 01:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493677, 646013, 90380, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of the pieces, but the DOF is a bit too shallow IMO.</td>', 'I like the arrangement of the pieces, but the DOF is a bit too shallow IMO.', '2008-02-18 01:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493679, 645783, 90380, '<td valign="top">I would score it higher but it looks a little out of focus. 6.</td>', 'I would score it higher but it looks a little out of focus. 6.', '2008-02-18 01:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493684, 646421, 90380, '<td valign="top">Yummy!! It''s an 8, only because I would like to see the bottom piece of bread either perfectly horizontal or more tilted. It''s just <i>slightly</i> askew which distracts me, but it definitely gets points for being appetizing!</td>', 'Yummy!! It''s an 8, only because I would like to see the bottom piece of bread either perfectly horizontal or more tilted. It''s just slightly askew which distracts me, but it definitely gets points for being appetizing!', '2008-02-18 01:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493687, 646286, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very sweet and simple. 8.</td>', 'Very sweet and simple. 8.', '2008-02-18 01:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493690, 646308, 90380, '<td valign="top">I love the treatment. It''s a great image, but bread is a little lacking in emphasis. Because of this I give it an 8, but so close to a 9.</td>', 'I love the treatment. It''s a great image, but bread is a little lacking in emphasis. Because of this I give it an 8, but so close to a 9.', '2008-02-18 01:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493692, 646313, 90380, '<td valign="top">I know the point is about the negative space, but I find myself wanting to see more. Maybe that''s a good thing..?</td>', 'I know the point is about the negative space, but I find myself wanting to see more. Maybe that''s a good thing..?', '2008-02-18 02:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493693, 645362, 90380, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I see a landscape first and bread second. Very well executed. 9.</td>', 'Cool idea. I see a landscape first and bread second. Very well executed. 9.', '2008-02-18 02:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493694, 646289, 90380, '<td valign="top">Cute kid and great lighting! 9.</td>', 'Cute kid and great lighting! 9.', '2008-02-18 02:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493695, 644701, 90380, '<td valign="top">The texure and colours are very eye-catching. 8.</td>', 'The texure and colours are very eye-catching. 8.', '2008-02-18 02:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493697, 645658, 90380, '<td valign="top">Wow, how many takes did this take?!! "A" for effort and 10 because it is so interesting!</td>', 'Wow, how many takes did this take?!! "A" for effort and 10 because it is so interesting!', '2008-02-18 02:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493750, 646428, 57775, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and well executed.</td>', 'Cute idea and well executed.', '2008-02-18 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493754, 646417, 57775, '<td valign="top">I can''t imagine how this was accomplished in basic editing.  Amazing job - 10.</td>', 'I can''t imagine how this was accomplished in basic editing.  Amazing job - 10.', '2008-02-18 02:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493756, 645944, 57775, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2008-02-18 02:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493757, 645658, 57775, '<td valign="top">I love the creativity here - curious to hear how you did this.</td>', 'I love the creativity here - curious to hear how you did this.', '2008-02-18 02:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493920, 646377, 80326, '<td valign="top">Might need a better lighting setup, 3-4 shadows for each object is distracting a bit.</td>', 'Might need a better lighting setup, 3-4 shadows for each object is distracting a bit.', '2008-02-18 06:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493922, 645689, 80326, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice image but I''d prefer if you moved the slices around a bit so they didn''t cast a shadow on the salt(?)</td>', 'It''s a nice image but I''d prefer if you moved the slices around a bit so they didn''t cast a shadow on the salt(?)', '2008-02-18 06:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4493926, 646013, 80326, '<td valign="top">DOF is too shallow here IMO.</td>', 'DOF is too shallow here IMO.', '2008-02-18 06:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494096, 646005, 90197, '<td valign="top">If only there would be more sharpens...</td>', 'If only there would be more sharpens...', '2008-02-18 08:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494232, 644329, 88613, '<td valign="top">Love this picture one of my favorites in whole challenge.</td>', 'Love this picture one of my favorites in whole challenge.', '2008-02-18 10:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494233, 646428, 88613, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Great job!</td>', 'Very creative. Great job!', '2008-02-18 10:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494401, 643437, 70896, '<td valign="top">The lighting is amazing! But I wish there was something in the basket... its the only thing missing for me.</td>', 'The lighting is amazing! But I wish there was something in the basket... its the only thing missing for me.', '2008-02-18 11:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494408, 645890, 48268, '<td valign="top">You could have used a deeper DOF or different lighting.  Because the light falls on the far hand that''s the first place my eye goes to and I think, "This is out of focus."</td>', 'You could have used a deeper DOF or different lighting.  Because the light falls on the far hand that''s the first place my eye goes to and I think, "This is out of focus."', '2008-02-18 11:48:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4494464, 645421, 26001, '<td valign="top">i am sure i wont be the only one to say, having the same "dotted" background would have helped the shot a lot. i understand that would have been particularly difficult to do with the reflection in the toaster though. nice try.</td>', 'i am sure i wont be the only one to say, having the same "dotted" background would have helped the shot a lot. i understand that would have been particularly difficult to do with the reflection in the toaster though. nice try.', '2008-02-18 12:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494480, 644330, 26001, '<td valign="top">i liked the original with the kid, especially because of lighting and gray tones. this one has both of those qualities and importantly equally good. cannot say that about the "concept" (naked mother-baby relation and naked woman-bread relation) though. hehehe :)</td>', 'i liked the original with the kid, especially because of lighting and gray tones. this one has both of those qualities and importantly equally good. cannot say that about the "concept" (naked mother-baby relation and naked woman-bread relation) though. hehehe :)', '2008-02-18 12:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494694, 643437, 90465, '<td valign="top">Exceptional use of spot lighting and dramatic exposure!</td>', 'Exceptional use of spot lighting and dramatic exposure!', '2008-02-18 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494702, 644329, 90465, '<td valign="top">Great aperture choice!  The depth of field really enhances the pic!</td>', 'Great aperture choice!  The depth of field really enhances the pic!', '2008-02-18 14:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494706, 646245, 90465, '<td valign="top">Create presentation, but the image captured is nothing spectacular.</td>', 'Create presentation, but the image captured is nothing spectacular.', '2008-02-18 14:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494716, 644735, 90465, '<td valign="top">I might have preferred more light on the base (making white, whiter).</td>', 'I might have preferred more light on the base (making white, whiter).', '2008-02-18 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494727, 646013, 90465, '<td valign="top">Strange aperture choice.</td>', 'Strange aperture choice.', '2008-02-18 14:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494820, 646454, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hey, I didn''t know my wife had entered this challenge! (She like things "crisp")</td>', 'Hey, I didn''t know my wife had entered this challenge! (She like things "crisp")', '2008-02-18 14:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494827, 644152, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very creative and funny. Unfortunately, the semi nude doesn''t get more points from me. <br/> <br/>As portraits go, she has a weird expression on her face, but a great portrait was not the objective here!</td>', 'Very creative and funny. Unfortunately, the semi nude doesn''t get more points from me.  As portraits go, she has a weird expression on her face, but a great portrait was not the objective here!', '2008-02-18 14:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494889, 646289, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute. Was it good?</td>', 'Cute. Was it good?', '2008-02-18 15:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494898, 645328, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting street photography. Not something I have done much of and I ought to try it sometime. This has a distracting background, though the backlighting with the subject in shadows is the main problem. Some fill flash may have helped.</td>', 'Interesting street photography. Not something I have done much of and I ought to try it sometime. This has a distracting background, though the backlighting with the subject in shadows is the main problem. Some fill flash may have helped.', '2008-02-18 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494902, 646476, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is it done yet? Bold and effective.</td>', 'Is it done yet? Bold and effective.', '2008-02-18 15:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494906, 645980, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost nailed it with this still life. Contrast is a bit dull though. Some adjustments to bring out the texture and colors would have improved this. Some variation on the lighting as well, perhaps, but I''m still experimenting with lighting myself. I''m not any expert in that area.</td>', 'Almost nailed it with this still life. Contrast is a bit dull though. Some adjustments to bring out the texture and colors would have improved this. Some variation on the lighting as well, perhaps, but I''m still experimenting with lighting myself. I''m not any expert in that area.', '2008-02-18 15:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494912, 646106, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really nice, though the crop is perhaps a little off for me. I would have placed the garlic a little lower and  to the left and brought more of the bread into the frame.</td>', 'Really nice, though the crop is perhaps a little off for me. I would have placed the garlic a little lower and  to the left and brought more of the bread into the frame.', '2008-02-18 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494982, 646421, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like the mouth of some alien creature! Or maybe a cave. Or it could be PB&amp;J...</td>', 'Looks like the mouth of some alien creature! Or maybe a cave. Or it could be PB&J...', '2008-02-18 16:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494990, 645783, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of depth of field here, and it could use some more contrast as well. Try a higher f-stop and a longer exposure for something like this, in order to get better DOF.</td>', 'Not a lot of depth of field here, and it could use some more contrast as well. Try a higher f-stop and a longer exposure for something like this, in order to get better DOF.', '2008-02-18 16:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4494999, 645542, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lots of great detail and color here. The lighting really helps bring it out. That bread looks delicious! The composition is not doing anything for me, though. It just too plain and centered for me.</td>', 'Lots of great detail and color here. The lighting really helps bring it out. That bread looks delicious! The composition is not doing anything for me, though. It just too plain and centered for me.', '2008-02-18 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495003, 645469, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s a story here. I''ll be looking forward to reading your notes on this shot when the challenge is over.</td>', 'There''s a story here. I''ll be looking forward to reading your notes on this shot when the challenge is over.', '2008-02-18 16:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495012, 646254, 83313, '<td valign="top">The bling around the neck is an interesting touch. Not sure whether I like it or if it takes away from the image. He does not strike me as the type to normally wear such stuff.</td>', 'The bling around the neck is an interesting touch. Not sure whether I like it or if it takes away from the image. He does not strike me as the type to normally wear such stuff.', '2008-02-18 16:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495017, 646265, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well composed, and good DOF for such a close, andgled shot. There''s a color cast, probably the white balance setting, that does not appeal to me.</td>', 'Well composed, and good DOF for such a close, andgled shot. There''s a color cast, probably the white balance setting, that does not appeal to me.', '2008-02-18 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495022, 646011, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice comparison. It does indeed look like the surface of the sun. I think the sunspots need a little butter.</td>', 'Nice comparison. It does indeed look like the surface of the sun. I think the sunspots need a little butter.', '2008-02-18 16:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495152, 646313, 55956, '<td valign="top">more than a minimalist photo is a minimal photo. the subject on the left border and the black that fill the frame have a true charm. the only little problem that I can see is the very small reflection on the low side of the glass. 7</td>', 'more than a minimalist photo is a minimal photo. the subject on the left border and the black that fill the frame have a true charm. the only little problem that I can see is the very small reflection on the low side of the glass. 7', '2008-02-18 17:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495178, 646019, 55956, '<td valign="top">interesting, I don''t like the composition and the background but the effect of the fire is very good. 6</td>', 'interesting, I don''t like the composition and the background but the effect of the fire is very good. 6', '2008-02-18 17:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495197, 646410, 85310, '<td valign="top">I think this might benefit from a slightly deeper depth of field, so that the orange wedge could be in focus and provide a textural contrast to the bread. I also wonder whether a slightly higher point of view might add to the setup.</td>', 'I think this might benefit from a slightly deeper depth of field, so that the orange wedge could be in focus and provide a textural contrast to the bread. I also wonder whether a slightly higher point of view might add to the setup.', '2008-02-18 17:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495200, 646006, 55956, '<td valign="top">good still life from compositional point of view. not a perfect control of the light everywhere. 6</td>', 'good still life from compositional point of view. not a perfect control of the light everywhere. 6', '2008-02-18 17:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495211, 643839, 85310, '<td valign="top">The overall picture seems a little dark to me. I like the restricted DOF, but I wonder whether focussing on the exposed internal texture of the bread at right might make for a more interesting textural study.</td>', 'The overall picture seems a little dark to me. I like the restricted DOF, but I wonder whether focussing on the exposed internal texture of the bread at right might make for a more interesting textural study.', '2008-02-18 17:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495227, 646285, 55956, '<td valign="top">the image is interesting but I think that there are two problems. the first is the not perfect DOF, I prefer more DOF here. the second is the reflection on the background. very good the point of view with the book in that position. perhaps a bookmark of cloth could add something here.</td>', 'the image is interesting but I think that there are two problems. the first is the not perfect DOF, I prefer more DOF here. the second is the reflection on the background. very good the point of view with the book in that position. perhaps a bookmark of cloth could add something here.', '2008-02-18 17:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495232, 643755, 85310, '<td valign="top">While I understand from your title that you were going for a simple look, the end result seems a little bland to my eyes. The texture of the bread is a little plain and the DOF seems too shallow. Without the title, I''m not sure I would recognize it as bread and not a sponge or loofah of some sort.<br/> <br/>Some additional side lighting might help to bring out the texture.</td>', 'While I understand from your title that you were going for a simple look, the end result seems a little bland to my eyes. The texture of the bread is a little plain and the DOF seems too shallow. Without the title, I''m not sure I would recognize it as bread and not a sponge or loofah of some sort. Some additional side lighting might help to bring out the texture.', '2008-02-18 17:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495238, 643754, 85310, '<td valign="top">Worth a chuckle or two ... I might try orienting the cloth at a diagonal to the bread.</td>', 'Worth a chuckle or two ... I might try orienting the cloth at a diagonal to the bread.', '2008-02-18 17:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495240, 646467, 55956, '<td valign="top">with bread and much other things... too much confused</td>', 'with bread and much other things... too much confused', '2008-02-18 17:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495241, 646138, 85310, '<td valign="top">Nice documentary feel to the picture.</td>', 'Nice documentary feel to the picture.', '2008-02-18 17:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495245, 645840, 55956, '<td valign="top">could be a good idea. I don''t like the white balance and few sharpness.</td>', 'could be a good idea. I don''t like the white balance and few sharpness.', '2008-02-18 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495249, 644775, 85310, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think it would work better if the entire loaf were in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think it would work better if the entire loaf were in sharp focus.', '2008-02-18 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495252, 644011, 85310, '<td valign="top">Not particularly sharp, underexposed, poor contrast.</td>', 'Not particularly sharp, underexposed, poor contrast.', '2008-02-18 17:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495255, 645444, 85310, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but I wonder about the black background.</td>', 'Very nice picture, but I wonder about the black background.', '2008-02-18 17:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495260, 646042, 85310, '<td valign="top">Nice atmosphere in this picture.</td>', 'Nice atmosphere in this picture.', '2008-02-18 17:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495270, 645693, 55956, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it''s magnetic. great the eyes of the devil on the fire. almost seems a blasphemous version of the eucharist. very emotive. from technical point of view is perfect, great portrait. 10</td>', 'I like this photo, it''s magnetic. great the eyes of the devil on the fire. almost seems a blasphemous version of the eucharist. very emotive. from technical point of view is perfect, great portrait. 10', '2008-02-18 17:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495292, 645269, 55956, '<td valign="top">ahahahaah it''s true, only after some second I have seen the bread. :)</td>', 'ahahahaah it''s true, only after some second I have seen the bread. :)', '2008-02-18 17:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495300, 645362, 55956, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2008-02-18 17:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495313, 644330, 55956, '<td valign="top">the photo is absolutely well done and the idea is good. the black and white is wonderful, the lighting excellent. I remember a similar shot some month ago..perhaps the photographer is the same. congrats. this is a great work. 10</td>', 'the photo is absolutely well done and the idea is good. the black and white is wonderful, the lighting excellent. I remember a similar shot some month ago..perhaps the photographer is the same. congrats. this is a great work. 10', '2008-02-18 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495339, 645770, 55956, '<td valign="top">a biblical photo. the light is interesting, the shadows intriguing. the subject have a good expression and good is the composition. 10</td>', 'a biblical photo. the light is interesting, the shadows intriguing. the subject have a good expression and good is the composition. 10', '2008-02-18 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495343, 646042, 55956, '<td valign="top">good composition and DOF good lighting.</td>', 'good composition and DOF good lighting.', '2008-02-18 17:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495668, 646328, 23098, '<td valign="top">Powerful little Sunbeam. :) Nice catch.</td>', 'Powerful little Sunbeam. :) Nice catch.', '2008-02-18 19:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4495674, 646417, 23098, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re ready for St. Paddy''s day. :)</td>', 'Looks like you''re ready for St. Paddy''s day. :)', '2008-02-18 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
