(4496145, 646489, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a well done image overall.  I dislike the crumb on the bottom of the bucket, and the background seems to change from pink, to green, to brown wood.  If you could have shot it at an angle that would have stopped you from seeing the green it might have looked even better.  8</td>', 'I think that this is a well done image overall.  I dislike the crumb on the bottom of the bucket, and the background seems to change from pink, to green, to brown wood.  If you could have shot it at an angle that would have stopped you from seeing the green it might have looked even better.  8', '2008-02-18 22:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496146, 645770, 59415, '<td valign="top">Is this the real Jesus?  Is he back?  I think the use of the lighting is what really makes this image work.  It was exactly the right choice.</td>', 'Is this the real Jesus?  Is he back?  I think the use of the lighting is what really makes this image work.  It was exactly the right choice.', '2008-02-18 22:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
