(4496159, 644654, 59415, '<td valign="top">Bread will cause you to be fat, but I have never had my bread bleed.  I think that the lighting could have been just a bit more dramatic to add a little bit more of a darker tone to the shot.  Maybe Black and White?</td>', 'Bread will cause you to be fat, but I have never had my bread bleed.  I think that the lighting could have been just a bit more dramatic to add a little bit more of a darker tone to the shot.  Maybe Black and White?', '2008-02-18 22:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
