(4496170, 645932, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think that the candlestick holders throw me off a bit.  I am not sure exactly why they are stacked that way.  It really doesn''t add a dramatic effect or help tell a story, but if they were upright and on the table I might have believed that it was an older image.</td>', 'I think that the candlestick holders throw me off a bit.  I am not sure exactly why they are stacked that way.  It really doesn''t add a dramatic effect or help tell a story, but if they were upright and on the table I might have believed that it was an older image.', '2008-02-18 22:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
