(4496214, 643273, 59415, '<td valign="top">Bread was a 1970s rock and roll band from Los Angeles, California. They were one of the most popular rock groups of the early 1970s, a primary example of what later was labeled soft rock, earning a string of well-crafted, melodic soft rock singles.<br/> <br/>The band consisted of David Gates (vocals, guitar, bass, keyboards, violin, viola, percussion), Jimmy Griffin (vocals, guitar, keyboards, percussion), Robb Royer (bass, guitar, flute, keyboards, percussion, recorder, backing vocals), Mike Botts (drums; joined in 1970), and Larry Knechtel (bass, guitar, keyboards, harmonica; replaced Royer in 1971).<br/> <br/>And yet this is the only image I have seen of them.</td>', 'Bread was a 1970s rock and roll band from Los Angeles, California. They were one of the most popular rock groups of the early 1970s, a primary example of what later was labeled soft rock, earning a string of well-crafted, melodic soft rock singles. The band consisted of David Gates (vocals, guitar, bass, keyboards, violin, viola, percussion), Jimmy Griffin (vocals, guitar, keyboards, percussion), Robb Royer (bass, guitar, flute, keyboards, percussion, recorder, backing vocals), Mike Botts (drums; joined in 1970), and Larry Knechtel (bass, guitar, keyboards, harmonica; replaced Royer in 1971). And yet this is the only image I have seen of them.', '2008-02-18 22:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4496215, 645959, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting very well done.</td>', 'Very good lighting very well done.', '2008-02-18 22:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
