(4499135, 645767, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like this - it''s a very nice candid.  What a yummy job he has!  I like seeing all that bread in the background too.</td>', 'I like this - it''s a very nice candid.  What a yummy job he has!  I like seeing all that bread in the background too.', '2008-02-19 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499136, 646197, 67697, '<td valign="top">heh - a well balanced meal?  That''s pretty cool with stacking the bread like that.</td>', 'heh - a well balanced meal?  That''s pretty cool with stacking the bread like that.', '2008-02-19 22:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499139, 644330, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  This looks great in black and white.  Love the draped cloth.  Darn her for being so flexible!</td>', 'Very pretty.  This looks great in black and white.  Love the draped cloth.  Darn her for being so flexible!', '2008-02-19 22:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499143, 643754, 67697, '<td valign="top">Funny!  I never knew that bread did some sunbathing.  Very cute.</td>', 'Funny!  I never knew that bread did some sunbathing.  Very cute.', '2008-02-19 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499146, 644561, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like that you used natural light to highlight the rolls.  They look golden yummy.</td>', 'I like that you used natural light to highlight the rolls.  They look golden yummy.', '2008-02-19 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499150, 644147, 67697, '<td valign="top">These look yummy.  I like the lighting on them - shows off the details of some of the pretzels pretty well.</td>', 'These look yummy.  I like the lighting on them - shows off the details of some of the pretzels pretty well.', '2008-02-19 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499155, 646191, 67697, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject comparison.  I''m curious about what kind of bread that is.  Looks like it has carrot in it.</td>', 'Interesting subject comparison.  I''m curious about what kind of bread that is.  Looks like it has carrot in it.', '2008-02-19 22:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499158, 646013, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement but I''d rather have seen the focus be a little wider (or deeper or whatever you are supposed to say). I''d like to have seen all of that single bread slice in the forground be in focus.</td>', 'I like the arrangement but I''d rather have seen the focus be a little wider (or deeper or whatever you are supposed to say). I''d like to have seen all of that single bread slice in the forground be in focus.', '2008-02-19 22:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499212, 646149, 88700, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition!</td>', 'Awesome composition!', '2008-02-19 23:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499220, 644735, 88700, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2008-02-19 23:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499224, 645932, 88700, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but I wish it was cropped more so that you coouldn''t see the floor.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but I wish it was cropped more so that you coouldn''t see the floor.', '2008-02-19 23:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499226, 646139, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great color!</td>', 'Great color!', '2008-02-19 23:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499228, 646371, 88700, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition!! I love this picture.</td>', 'Awesome composition!! I love this picture.', '2008-02-19 23:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499234, 646447, 90122, '<td valign="top">Wonderful mood here. I like the composition and the depth of field. It really elicits a feeling of old-age toil, with the dough on the fingers substituting wrinkles produced by a lifetime of labor.</td>', 'Wonderful mood here. I like the composition and the depth of field. It really elicits a feeling of old-age toil, with the dough on the fingers substituting wrinkles produced by a lifetime of labor.', '2008-02-19 23:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499237, 646428, 88700, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I love the creativity!</td>', 'Great composition.  I love the creativity!', '2008-02-19 23:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499240, 646489, 88700, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.</td>', 'Nice DOF.', '2008-02-19 23:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499241, 645410, 90122, '<td valign="top">I especially like the lighting here. I am partial to the golden tones in depicting artisan-style bread. The background also contributes to an overall sense of golden lighting, but doesn''t overwhelm the photo (i.e. the more open, unintruded space in the upper right corner).</td>', 'I especially like the lighting here. I am partial to the golden tones in depicting artisan-style bread. The background also contributes to an overall sense of golden lighting, but doesn''t overwhelm the photo (i.e. the more open, unintruded space in the upper right corner).', '2008-02-19 23:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499245, 646416, 88700, '<td valign="top">Clever composition!</td>', 'Clever composition!', '2008-02-19 23:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499247, 643860, 88700, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of light.</td>', 'Interesting use of light.', '2008-02-19 23:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499254, 646138, 90122, '<td valign="top">This is a really good storytelling shot, aided by a nice use of contrast, black and white, and large depth of field. I think everything is about right for what you seem to have tried to do here, including the cropping and the composition of elements in a sort of curvilinear organization. Makes me hungry for some chicken tandoori and some authentic naan bread (which, by the way, I''ve been craving for the last couple of weeks).</td>', 'This is a really good storytelling shot, aided by a nice use of contrast, black and white, and large depth of field. I think everything is about right for what you seem to have tried to do here, including the cropping and the composition of elements in a sort of curvilinear organization. Makes me hungry for some chicken tandoori and some authentic naan bread (which, by the way, I''ve been craving for the last couple of weeks).', '2008-02-19 23:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499260, 646243, 88700, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2008-02-19 23:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499262, 644011, 88700, '<td valign="top">I wish the photo was of better quality and the bread was in focus.</td>', 'I wish the photo was of better quality and the bread was in focus.', '2008-02-19 23:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499264, 645469, 90122, '<td valign="top">Very moody--almost surreal: like she crawled out of a withered brick wall just to ingest some bread. Of course, the thing about being a character in a mural is you probably wouldn''t know what to do with the bread. Great work.</td>', 'Very moody--almost surreal: like she crawled out of a withered brick wall just to ingest some bread. Of course, the thing about being a character in a mural is you probably wouldn''t know what to do with the bread. Great work.', '2008-02-19 23:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499266, 646245, 88700, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2008-02-19 23:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499267, 646415, 88700, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but I wish more of the photo was in focus.</td>', 'Cute idea but I wish more of the photo was in focus.', '2008-02-19 23:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499270, 645991, 88700, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting.', '2008-02-19 23:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4499278, 645376, 88700, '<td valign="top">Clever composition, and nice use of color!</td>', 'Clever composition, and nice use of color!', '2008-02-19 23:24:05.000000', NULL, 1);
