(4499961, 646044, 30982, '<td valign="top">Too freakin'' cute!  I actually like this a lot.  I like the rather stark and desolate nature of it.  It has a "gravity of the situation" type thing going for it.</td>', 'Too freakin'' cute!  I actually like this a lot.  I like the rather stark and desolate nature of it.  It has a "gravity of the situation" type thing going for it.', '2008-02-20 05:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499962, 644011, 2158, '<td valign="top">The grain is caused by the high ISO.  Set your ISO to the lowest number possible and use a tripod (or some other support if you do not have a tripod) to keep your camera from moving while the photo is being taken.  This photo also suffers a lot as a result of poor lighting.</td>', 'The grain is caused by the high ISO.  Set your ISO to the lowest number possible and use a tripod (or some other support if you do not have a tripod) to keep your camera from moving while the photo is being taken.  This photo also suffers a lot as a result of poor lighting.', '2008-02-20 05:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499963, 644329, 64568, '<td valign="top">My choice for the Blue- beautiful lighting and expression- well done Michelle- very well deserved.</td>', 'My choice for the Blue- beautiful lighting and expression- well done Michelle- very well deserved.', '2008-02-20 05:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4499964, 646476, 30982, '<td valign="top">Did rather well despite the size!  Not sure all that many people really even caught that part since it''s not teensy and it is big enough to see.  Neil''s comment is worth it.  :-)</td>', 'Did rather well despite the size!  Not sure all that many people really even caught that part since it''s not teensy and it is big enough to see.  Neil''s comment is worth it.  :-)', '2008-02-20 05:10:06.000000', NULL, 0),
