(4500846, 645362, 82225, '<td valign="top">amazing, creative and fabulous shot. good work. i''m very critical, and gave you 8, 8 was the highest grade that i gave to several pics.</td>', 'amazing, creative and fabulous shot. good work. i''m very critical, and gave you 8, 8 was the highest grade that i gave to several pics.', '2008-02-20 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500861, 643437, 24550, '<td valign="top">ah just missed it! i was sure this would ribbon (gave you a 10)</td>', 'ah just missed it! i was sure this would ribbon (gave you a 10)', '2008-02-20 11:53:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500877, 646430, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very clever set-up! <br/>I actually like the light spilling out from the bottom. The tones and reflections are beautiful. After just recently trying to shoot a shiny toaster myself, I can safely say you did a terrific job lighting this really tough subject. ;) I wonder how it might look if the light was more golden/yellow? I personally think the rough brown toast clashes a bit with the clean white surroundings. But maybe that''s a good thing. <br/>Just a thought.</td>', 'Very clever set-up! I actually like the light spilling out from the bottom. The tones and reflections are beautiful. After just recently trying to shoot a shiny toaster myself, I can safely say you did a terrific job lighting this really tough subject. ;) I wonder how it might look if the light was more golden/yellow? I personally think the rough brown toast clashes a bit with the clean white surroundings. But maybe that''s a good thing. Just a thought.', '2008-02-20 11:57:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4500883, 646430, 24550, '<td valign="top">this was one of my ribbon candidates.</td>', 'this was one of my ribbon candidates.', '2008-02-20 12:00:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4501066, 643860, 17986, '<td valign="top">Wow, I did not expect to do quite as well as I did. This was my first challenge and I gotta say, It was so much fun to login every couple of hours and watch the voting progress.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all of the comments!<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=62249" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">quiche</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=70689" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mark_u_U</a> are exactly right. I wish I had thought about adding a back light to give the top of the bread some separation from the background.<br/> <br/>Also, in case anyone is wondering, it''s not toast, just a piece white bread resting against a Glade candle.<br/> <br/>Cody</td>', 'Wow, I did not expect to do quite as well as I did. This was my first challenge and I gotta say, It was so much fun to login every couple of hours and watch the voting progress. Thanks for all of the comments! quiche and  mark_u_U are exactly right. I wish I had thought about adding a back light to give the top of the bread some separation from the background. Also, in case anyone is wondering, it''s not toast, just a piece white bread resting against a Glade candle. Cody', '2008-02-20 12:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4501183, 644152, 61552, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I didn''t get the coveted Brown Ribbon!<br/> <br/>I hope I brought a laugh or two.</td>', 'Wow!  I didn''t get the coveted Brown Ribbon! I hope I brought a laugh or two.', '2008-02-20 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4501228, 645362, 60383, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion this is by far the best pic in this challenge. The number 1 is a good one, but a great shame that this one didn''t score the highest.<br/> <br/>Anyways, congratulations on the ribbon.<br/> <br/>-</td>', 'In my humble opinion this is by far the best pic in this challenge. The number 1 is a good one, but a great shame that this one didn''t score the highest. Anyways, congratulations on the ribbon. -', '2008-02-20 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
