(4501326, 646134, 66384, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice old-time rural feel about this shot -- very genuine. I like the lighting, color, focus, detail, and texture. Something about the composition is a little uncomfortable, but I can''t put my finger on it exactly. The arrangement of the three items: loaf, slice, and knife, just seem unbalanced or unnatural.</td>', 'There''s a nice old-time rural feel about this shot -- very genuine. I like the lighting, color, focus, detail, and texture. Something about the composition is a little uncomfortable, but I can''t put my finger on it exactly. The arrangement of the three items: loaf, slice, and knife, just seem unbalanced or unnatural.', '2008-02-20 14:19:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4501346, 645826, 66384, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy. I like the composition. Nice job on the focus. The textures are all very palpable.</td>', 'Looks yummy. I like the composition. Nice job on the focus. The textures are all very palpable.', '2008-02-20 14:29:36.000000', NULL, 0),
