(4501401, 646437, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines and colors of the horn of plenty and pillow. I think the paper plate spoils the image, because everything else has such nice warmth and texture. I like the lighting too.</td>', 'I really like the lines and colors of the horn of plenty and pillow. I think the paper plate spoils the image, because everything else has such nice warmth and texture. I like the lighting too.', '2008-02-20 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 0),
