(4502839, 643426, 83032, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC...this is the place to learn how to do it better...must have thick skin at times though.  I agree with many of the comments about all or none of the wine glass.  You might want to learn how to use adjustment layers to tweek your imagines...just try not to over saturate as that is a tendency around here and most of the time it doesn''t produce a good score.  Another really good thing to do is go thru the photo archives and read the comments on a few of what think is good or bad and see what people are saying.  Good luck, I think you will love it here....the more you put in, the more you get out of this place.  Welcome.<br/></td>', 'Welcome to DPC...this is the place to learn how to do it better...must have thick skin at times though.  I agree with many of the comments about all or none of the wine glass.  You might want to learn how to use adjustment layers to tweek your imagines...just try not to over saturate as that is a tendency around here and most of the time it doesn''t produce a good score.  Another really good thing to do is go thru the photo archives and read the comments on a few of what think is good or bad and see what people are saying.  Good luck, I think you will love it here....the more you put in, the more you get out of this place.  Welcome.', '2008-02-20 22:17:42.000000', NULL, 0),
