(4509320, 644329, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh...I leave the country for a few days and come back to find you have won a blue...with a plus seven average... and your second highest ever score<br/> <br/>Where do the congratulations start?<br/> <br/>I thought this was a real stand out shot in the challenge, great filled frame, sharpness, good use of DOF and a super expression on the little critters face<br/> <br/>Good job...no make that...great job</td>', 'Oh my gosh...I leave the country for a few days and come back to find you have won a blue...with a plus seven average... and your second highest ever score Where do the congratulations start? I thought this was a real stand out shot in the challenge, great filled frame, sharpness, good use of DOF and a super expression on the little critters face Good job...no make that...great job', '2008-02-23 05:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
